# Version control
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes
**/.github
**/.gitlab-ci.yml
**/.azure-pipelines
**/azure-pipelines*.yml

# Docker files (not needed inside the build context)
**/.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*
**/compose*.y*ml
# Dockerfiles are read by the daemon directly, so they can be excluded from the context:
# **/Dockerfile*

# IDEs / editors
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.history
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.iml
**/*.DotSettings.user
**/*.code-workspace
**/_ReSharper*

# .NET build output (restored/built inside the image)
**/bin
**/obj
**/publish
**/artifacts/*
# Exception: runtime-only Dockerfiles COPY artifacts/publish/<deployable>/ from the repository root.
# It must come after the two excludes above (the last matching rule wins), and the artifacts directory
# itself is not excluded (only its children) so the re-include is not blocked by an excluded parent.
# Excludes below (*.pdb, *.log, secrets, ...) still apply inside artifacts/publish.
!artifacts/publish
**/.nuget
**/*.nupkg
**/*.snupkg
**/*.binlog
**/*.pdb

# Tests / coverage
**/TestResults
**/coverage
**/*.trx
**/*.coverage
**/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts
**/StrykerOutput

# Logs and temp
**/*.log
**/*.tmp

# Local config & secrets - never bake into an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.snk
**/launchSettings.json

# Angular / Node (installed and built inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out-tsc
**/.angular
**/.nx
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/.cache
**/.parcel-cache
**/.sass-cache
**/.eslintcache
**/.nyc_output
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*
**/cypress/videos
**/cypress/screenshots
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/storybook-static

# Docs & tooling that don't belong in an image
**/.claude
**/CLAUDE*.md
**/.migrate-tmp
**/REPO-STRUCTURE.md
